# ── transient per-run artifacts (local only) ────────────────────────────
# RUNNABLE-AS-CLEAN (leader requirement): a harness run must leave the tree
# CLEAN under the harness dir, so every artifact the harness writes is
# ignored here.  The COMMITTED evidence set stays exactly:
#   BASELINE.full.json  (the PRE-REPAIR baseline artifact — historical record)
#   run_full.out        (its console log)
#   evidence/           (its 5 wedge captures + the faulthandler dump)
run-*/
bootprobe/
run_smoke*.out
run_*.*.out
BASELINE.smoke*.json
BASELINE.*.base.json
BASELINE.*.head.json
BASELINE.*.simulated.json
bodies-*/
